" volee   1 Tree   2 Network   3 Repos   4 Timeline                                                       ?2 ✉5 !2 ▸6 12 "
"╭ ╭ All keys · [tui.keys] in config.toml changes them · esc closes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                        Agents list                       Hierarchy                                    │ │"
"│ │ '               jump to…          h, ←            parent            h, ←            left                         │ │"
"│ │ -               jump back         j, ↓            next              j, ↓            below                        │ │"
"│ │ /               filter            k, ↑            previous          k, ↑            above                        │ │"
"│▌│ n               next match        l, →            child             l, →            right                        │ │"
"│ │ N               previous match    gg, home        first             gg, home        first                        │ │"
"│ │ m               message           G, end          last              G, end          last                         │ │"
"│ │ d, ␣gd          diff              ctrl-d, pgdn    half page down    s               subtree                      │ │"
"│ │ enter, i, a, I  open              ctrl-u, pgup    half page up      +, =            zoom in                      │ │"
"│ │ z, ␣wm          full screen       s               subtree           _               zoom out                     │ │"
"│ │ ␣n              messages          +, =            zoom in           0               auto zoom                    │ │"
"│ │ o, ␣o           open with…        _               zoom out                                                       │ │"
"│ │ ␣aa             adopt             0               auto zoom         Network                                      │ │"
"│ │ ␣ad             forget                                              h, ←            left                         │ │"
"│ │ ␣an             new agent         Repositories                      j, ↓            below                        │ │"
"╰─│ ␣am             new mission       j, ↓            next              k, ↑            above                        │ │"
"╭ │ 5, ␣ww          wall              k, ↑            previous          l, →            right                        │ │"
"│ │ ␣uC             theme…            h, ←            previous repo     gg, home        first                        │ │"
"│ │ ␣sk             all keys          l, →            next repo         G, end          last                         │ │"
"│ │ :               commands          gg, home        first             +, =            zoom in                      │ │"
"│ │ tab             next panel        G, end          last              _               zoom out                     │ │"
"│ │ shift-tab       previous panel    +, =            zoom in           0               auto zoom                    │ │"
"│ │ ctrl-h          panel left        _               zoom out                                                       │ │"
"│ │ ctrl-j          panel below       0               auto zoom         Timeline                                     │ │"
"│ │ ctrl-k          panel above                                         j, ↓            next lane                    │ │"
"╰─│ ctrl-l          panel right       Detail and preview                k, ↑            previous lane                │─╯"
"╭ │ ␣up             preview           j, ↓            scroll down       h, ←            back in time                 │─╮"
"│ │ ctrl-→          wider list        k, ↑            scroll up         l, →            forward in time              │ │"
"│ │ ctrl-←          narrower list     ctrl-d, pgdn    half page down    [               previous event               │ │"
"│ │ ctrl-↑          taller            ctrl-u, pgup    half page up      ]               next event                   │ │"
"│ │ ctrl-↓          shorter           r               refresh           gg, home        first                        │ │"
"│ │ ␣w=             equal panels                                        G, end          last                         │ │"
"│ │ 1               tree              Full screen                       +, =            zoom in                      │ │"
"│ │ 2               network           k, ↑            scroll up         _               zoom out                     │ │"
"│ │ 3               repositories      j, ↓            scroll down       0               now                          │ │"
"│ │ 4               timeline          ctrl-u, pgup    half page up                                                   │ │"
"╰─╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────▼─╯─╯"
